<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers via Japan Big Four.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers via Japan Big Four.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors via Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Wednesday showed a net buying stance, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed seven million shares of sell orders against eight million shares of buy orders.</p>
